# Agent basics

## Environment

Assume this PC: Windows 11 64-bit, 16 GB RAM, Intel i7-1165G7 class. Keep the IDE and agent workflows light.

Product runtime is PowerShell 5.1 and Framework 4.8.1. Do not assume `pwsh`, `dotnet`, or extra SDKs.

## Comments

Public types and methods get a short summary (Japanese is fine): purpose, parameters, return value. Skip comments that only repeat the name. Comment non-obvious rules (Excel COM, encoding, csc flags, font fallback).

## PowerShell 5.1

In `*.ps1` used by the product or `build/`: no `&&` / `||` chains, no `??`, no PowerShell 7 syntax. Use `powershell.exe`, not `pwsh`.
